flowchart LR
    User[Notebook user] --> Agent[Microsoft Agent Framework agent]

    Agent -->|Model request| Inference[APIM OpenAI v1 inference API]
    Inference -->|Managed identity| Model[Microsoft Foundry model]

    Agent -->|Streamable HTTP| McpGateway[APIM Countries MCP server]
    McpGateway -->|MCP /mcp| Translator[graphql-mcp on Container Apps]
    Translator -->|GraphQL introspection and queries| GraphqlGateway[APIM Countries GraphQL API]
    GraphqlGateway --> Countries[Countries GraphQL API]

    Registry[Azure Container Registry] -.->|Container image| Translator
    ApiCenter[Azure API Center] -.->|Registers MCP deployment| McpGateway
    ApiCenter -.->|Registers GraphQL deployment| GraphqlGateway
    Monitor[Application Insights and Log Analytics] -.-> Inference
    Monitor -.-> McpGateway
    Monitor -.-> GraphqlGateway

